<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of</p>
<p>Sunday's games in the Copa Centenario tournament, being played</p>
<p>to celebrate the 100th anniversay of the founding of Belo</p>
<p>Horizonte.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Flamengo (Brazil) 2 Olimpia (Paraguay) 2 (halftime 0-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Flamengo - Lucio (55), Savio (81)</p>
<p>Olimpia - Luis Monzon (20, penalty), Francsico Esteche</p>
<p>(45)</p>
<p>Cruzeiro (Brazil) 4 Benfica (Portugal) 1 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cruzeiro - Roberto Gaucho (43, penalty), Geovani (57,73),</p>
<p>Fabio Junior (88)</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p> Cruzeiro	   1  1  0  0  4  1  3</p>
<p> Flamengo	   1  0  1  0  2  2  1</p>
<p> Olimpia	    1  0  1  0  2  2  1</p>
<p> Benfica	    1  0  0  1  1  4  0</p>
</text>
